<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Huanyu on 小甲哥の垃圾工厂</title><link>https://alecthw.github.io/tags/huanyu/</link><description>Recent content in Huanyu on 小甲哥の垃圾工厂</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>zh-cn</language><lastBuildDate>Sun, 16 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://alecthw.github.io/tags/huanyu/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>寰宇云机场怎么样？线路、套餐、解锁与优惠码</title><link>https://alecthw.github.io/p/airport-huanyu/</link><pubDate>Sun, 16 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://alecthw.github.io/p/airport-huanyu/</guid><description>&lt;img src="https://alecthw.github.io/p/airport-huanyu/cover.jpg" alt="Featured image of post 寰宇云机场怎么样？线路、套餐、解锁与优惠码" /&gt;&lt;p&gt;寰宇云机场适合流量消耗较大、希望同时兼顾流媒体和 AI 服务、并且需要多平台使用的人。它采用 AnyTLS，线路由直连与专线混合组成，同时提供订阅链接和自研客户端。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;**测试结论：**寰宇云的优势是流量额度、解锁覆盖和上手门槛，适合看剧、下载或多设备使用。线路不是所有节点都采用同一种接入方式，购买前仍应在自己的运营商网络中进行月付测试。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;h2 id="快速结论"&gt;快速结论
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="适合谁"&gt;适合谁
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;经常观看流媒体或有较大下载流量&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;需要 ChatGPT、Gemini、Midjourney 等 AI 服务&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;同时使用手机、电脑、软路由等多个平台&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;希望既能用官方客户端，也能导入第三方客户端&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;除常用地区外，还需要部分东南亚或小众落地&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 id="不适合谁"&gt;不适合谁
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;只想购买价格最低的备用机场&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;要求所有节点都是同一规格的纯专线&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;需要非常多的冷门国家和地区节点&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 id="套餐优惠码与入口"&gt;套餐、优惠码与入口
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;style&gt;
.airport-card{margin:1.8rem 0;border-radius:14px;background:var(--card-background,#fff);border:1px solid var(--card-separator-color,rgba(0,0,0,.08));box-shadow:0 2px 14px rgba(0,0,0,.06);overflow:hidden}
.airport-rows{display:flex;flex-direction:column}
.airport-row{padding:1rem 1.4rem;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:.7rem}
.airport-row+.airport-row{border-top:1px dashed var(--card-separator-color,rgba(0,0,0,.08))}
.airport-info{padding:.85rem 1.4rem;background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(255,184,77,.18),rgba(255,184,77,.04));border-bottom:1px dashed rgba(240,160,64,.4);font-size:1.4rem;color:var(--card-text-color-main,#333);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.55rem;line-height:1.5}
.airport-info::before{content:"📣";flex:0 0 auto}
.airport-coupon{position:relative;display:inline-flex;align-items:stretch;border:1.5px dashed #f0a040;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fff7e6 0%,#ffe4cc 100%);border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;cursor:pointer;font-family:inherit;font-size:1.4rem;padding:0;line-height:1.4;color:inherit;transition:transform .15s ease,box-shadow .15s ease}
.airport-coupon:hover{transform:translateY(-1px);box-shadow:0 4px 12px rgba(240,160,64,.32)}
.airport-coupon-desc{padding:.5rem .85rem;color:#7a4500;font-weight:500;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:.35rem}
.airport-coupon-code{padding:.5rem 1rem;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ff7a00 0%,#ff4d4d 100%);color:#fff;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.06em;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:.35rem}
.airport-coupon-code::before{content:"📋";font-size:.9em;opacity:.9}
.airport-coupon.expired{opacity:.5;cursor:not-allowed;text-decoration:line-through}
.airport-coupon.expired:hover{transform:none;box-shadow:none}
.airport-coupon-feedback{position:absolute;inset:0;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#10b981,#059669);color:#fff;font-weight:600;font-size:1.35rem;opacity:0;transform:scale(.9);transition:opacity .2s ease,transform .2s ease;pointer-events:none;letter-spacing:.03em}
.airport-coupon.copied .airport-coupon-feedback{opacity:1;transform:scale(1)}
.airport-coupon.copied .airport-coupon-feedback::before{content:"✓ 已复制"}
.airport-cta{flex:1 1 auto;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:.5rem;padding:.85rem 1.6rem;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#2563eb 0%,#7c3aed 100%);color:#fff!important;text-decoration:none!important;font-weight:600;font-size:1.55rem;border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 4px 14px rgba(37,99,235,.32);transition:transform .18s ease,box-shadow .18s ease;min-width:220px;border:none}
.airport-cta:hover{transform:translateY(-1px);box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(37,99,235,.42)}
.airport-mirror{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:.4rem;padding:.7rem 1.1rem;background:transparent;color:#2563eb!important;text-decoration:none!important;border:1.5px solid rgba(37,99,235,.45);border-radius:10px;font-weight:500;font-size:1.35rem;transition:background .15s ease,border-color .15s ease}
.airport-mirror:hover{background:rgba(37,99,235,.08);border-color:rgba(37,99,235,.7)}
.airport-protocol{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:.45rem;padding:.5rem 1rem;background:rgba(124,58,237,.08);border:1px solid rgba(124,58,237,.28);border-radius:999px;font-size:1.35rem;color:var(--card-text-color-secondary,#555);white-space:nowrap}
.airport-protocol strong{font-weight:700;color:#7c3aed;letter-spacing:.02em}
.airport-features{list-style:none!important;margin:0!important;padding:0!important;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:.45rem;width:100%}
.airport-features li{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.6rem;font-size:1.4rem;color:var(--card-text-color-main,#333);list-style:none;margin:0}
.airport-features li::before{content:none!important}
.airport-feature-icon{flex:0 0 1.5rem;height:1.5rem;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:50%;font-size:.95rem;font-weight:700;line-height:1}
.airport-feature-icon.ok{background:#d4f4dd;color:#1e7e34}
.airport-feature-icon.no{background:#fde2e1;color:#c0392b}
.airport-feature-icon.warn{background:#fff4cf;color:#a07406}
[data-scheme=dark] .airport-card{border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.08);box-shadow:0 2px 14px rgba(0,0,0,.28)}
